      "explanation": "First note that \\(x\\ne3\\), because the denominator \\(x-3\\) cannot be zero. For any allowed value of \\(x\\), add \\(\\frac7{x-3}\\) to both sides. The identical fractional terms cancel, leaving\n\\[\nx=3.\n\\]\nBut this value makes the original equation undefined. Therefore the equation has \\(\\boxed{\\text{no root}}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
